Phase 5 – Build the UI

Only focus on making the screens look good.

No AI.

No database.

No login.

Just navigation.

Phase 6 – Navigation

Learn React Navigation.

Users should be able to move between screens.

For example:

Home

↓

Survey

↓

Results

↓

Profile
Phase 7 – Create the survey

Questions like:

What subjects do you enjoy?
Do you enjoy working with people?
Would you rather work indoors or outdoors?
What matters most to you in a job?
What hobbies do you have?

Store the answers in memory first.

Phase 8 – Build the backend (Python)

Now start learning Python.

You'll build an API using FastAPI.

It will:

Receive survey answers.
Process them.
Return career recommendations.

Example:

App

↓

Python API

↓

Career Analysis

↓

Results
Phase 9 – Add AI

Instead of writing all the career advice yourself, your Python backend can send the survey data to an AI model.

The AI returns suggestions, which your app displays.

Phase 10 – Database

Add:

User accounts
Saved results
Favourite careers
Progress tracking
Phase 11 – Improve the app

Examples:

Dark mode
Animations
Charts
Accessibility improvements
Better error handling
Documentation to use

